@startuml
title E2E journey for Service API exposure (Aggregator and CSP)

actor "Application\nProvider\\\nApplication" as App
box "Aggregator" #E8F5E9
participant "Partner\nPlatform" as PP
end box
box "Operator" #EAF2FB
participant "OGW\nPlatform" as OGW
end box
participant "Operator" as Op

== 1. Channel Partner/CSP Catalog Sync ==
PP -[#red]> OGW : 1.1 Request API product catalog
OGW -[#red]-> PP : 1.2 Share available GSMA-compliant APIs
PP -[#red]> OGW : 1.3 Subscribe to catalog updates
OGW -[#red]> PP : 1.4 Send catalog updates when available
PP -> PP : 1.5 Map CSP products to partner offerings

== 2. Organization & Application Onboarding ==
App -[#green]> PP : 2.1 Register organization
App -[#green]> PP : 2.4 Register application

== 3. Catalog Browsing ==
App -[#green]> PP : 3.1 Browse available API products
PP -[#green]> App : 3.2 Display API catalog with specifications
App -[#green]> PP : 3.3 Request API documentation
PP -[#green]> App : 3.4 Provide API documentation and examples

== 4. API Product Management ==
App -> PP : 4.1 Request API subscription
PP -[#red]> OGW : 2.2 Create Application Owner
OGW -[#red]-> PP : 2.3 Approve Application Owner Creation
PP -[#red]> OGW : 2.5 Create application profile
OGW -[#red]-> PP : 2.6 Provide application profile
PP -[#green]> App : 2.7 Deliver account confirmation & application credentials
PP -[#red]> OGW : 4.2 Create Access Product Order
OGW -[#red]-> PP : 4.3 Approve Order
PP -[#green]> App : 4.4 Deliver API Access & usage policies

== 5. API Consumption ==
App <-[#blue]> Op
note left of App : Covered in Section 3.1.1.

== 6. API Usage Reporting ==
OGW -[#red]> PP : 6.1 Generate usage metrics
PP -[#green]> App : 6.2 Provide usage dashboard
OGW -[#red]> PP : 6.3 Send billing information
PP -[#green]> App : 6.4 Invoice for API consumption

legend right
  **Interaction Types**
  <color:green>→</color> User Interface
  <color:red>→</color> TMForum API Call
  <color:red>→</color> TMForum API Call Response
  <color:blue>→</color> CAMARA API Call
endlegend

@enduml
